// A shared life: a flat with two roommates, a loan to a friend, cash tips, a work
// expense waiting to be reimbursed, and the small garden collective that Alex is
// treasurer of, with a grant. March to December 2025.
//
// The folders are constraints: journal/2025/03.ax holds March 2025 only.

base USD

use std
use us

/// Alex, 28, a bartender at The Lantern, single, and treasurer of the collective.
entity me : person
  born   1996-11-08
  filing single
  lives  us

/// A volunteer garden collective, with a bank account in its own name that Alex
/// signs for. It does not `live` anywhere: a nonprofit pays no income tax, and
/// that is spelled by writing nothing.
entity green-table : org
